ls to fulfill this step effectively! I’m curious about what I’ll find in that file.\"}]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_uasYFzA3uatMx0ZYYwnZ9jvf|fc_087388a10928779c0169e03d43a1848191bf404caf0191f1b3","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"skills/fuiou_merchant_onboarding_skill/fuiou_fil_step1_license/01_area&category/SKILL.md"},"partialJson":"{\"path\":\"skills/fuiou_merchant_onboarding_skill/fuiou_fil_step1_license/01_area&category/SKILL.md\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.2","usage":{"input":463,"output":61,"cacheRead":17536,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18060,"cost":{"input":0.00081025,"output":0.0008539999999999999,"cacheRead":0.0030688,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00473305}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776303424253}}
{"type":"message","id":"b2f66a72","parentId":"66263253","timestamp":"2026-04-16T01:37:08.067Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_uasYFzA3uatMx0ZYYwnZ9jvf|fc_087388a10928779c0169e03d43a1848191bf404caf0191f1b3","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# step1of5-region-and-category\n\n填写 \"商户入网 - 执照信息 (1/5 步)\" 页面的两个滚轮字段:\n- 商户所在地区 (3 列滚轮 picker)\n- 商户类别    (1 列滚轮 picker)\n\n前置: 设备已经停留在执照信息表单页 (本 skill 不负责导航到该页).\n\n## 常量 (硬编码在 runner.py)\n\n```\nADB       = /opt/homebrew/Caskroom/android-platform-tools/36.0.2/platform-tools/adb\nDEVICE    = GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK\nPKG       = com.fuiou.pay.fybussess\nOCR       = PaddleOCR v3 (use_textline_orientation=False, lang=ch)\nSELECT    = box 高度最大 = 当前选中项\nSWIPE     = swipe(x, target.y_screen, x, current.y_screen)   # 相对 y 差, 无固定 item_height\nGATE      = rid 定位 titleBarTitle / pickTitleTv / pickerTitleTv 的 text, 不 grep 字符串\nSTATE     = state.json  # { \"region\":{\"prov\",\"city\",\"distric\"}, \"category\":\"...\" }\nFIELDS    = region:(610,651)  category:(577,800)\nPICKERS   = region_picker(3列, confirm(999,1323))  category_picker(1列, confirm(999,1793))\n```\n\n## 入口\n\n```\npython3 runner.py run_all\n```\n\n`run_all` 流程:\n```\ngate_in_form → load_state → tap region → wheel(3 col) → confirm → verify\n             → tap category → wheel(1 col) → confirm → verify → OK\n```\n\n任一子步骤失败都立即抛 NEED_LLM, 不跳过后续步骤.\nstdout 输出单行 JSON, `status` ∈ {`OK`, `NEED_LLM`, `ERROR`}.\n\n## NEED_LLM 处理表\n\nreason 字段与 runner.py 的 `result_need_llm()` 完全一致, 一行一行对应.\n\n| reason              | 触发条件                                             | llm_action (runner 返回里带)                                          |\n| ------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| target_missing      | state.json 缺 region 或 category                    | `python3 runner.py set_target --prov X --city Y --distric Z --category C` |\n| not_on_form_page    | gate_in 时不在执照信息表单页 (可能卡在某 picker)     | `python3 runner.py diagnose_page`                                     |\n| picker_not_open     | tap 字段后目标 picker 未弹出                         | `python3 runner.py diagnose_page`                                     |\n| ocr_empty           | 某列 OCR 没识别到任何文字                            | `python3 runner.py dump_debug --picker <region_picker\\|category_picker>` |\n| target_not_in_list  | 两个方向盲滑都撞边界, 目标仍不可见                   | `python3 runner.py list_column --picker <name> --col <col>`           |\n| scroll_exhausted    | 达到 MAX_SCROLL_TRIES=12 仍未命中                    | `python3 runner.py list_column --picker <name> --col <col>`           |\n| confirm_failed      | 点确定后 picker 仍在前台                             | `python3 runner.py dump_debug --picker <name>`                        |\n| field_not_found     | 验证时找不到字段节点                                 | `python3 runner.py diagnose_page`                                     |\n| field_mismatch      | 填完后字段显示的文本与期望不符                       | `python3 runner.py diagnose_page`                                     |\n\n## LLM 处理规则\n\n1. 收到 NEED_LLM 只处理**当前这一步**, 处理完立即重跑 `run_all`, 绝不手动接管后续.\n2. `target_missing`: 从用户意图取地址+类别, 调 `set_target`, 然后重跑 `run_all`.\n3. `scroll_exhausted` / `target_not_in_list`: 调 `list_column` 看可见候选, 用最相近的文本 `set_target` 覆盖后重跑.\n4. `not_on_form_page` / `picker_not_open` / `confirm_failed` / `field_mismatch` / `field_not_found` / `ocr_empty`: 读 `diagnose_page` / `dump_debug` 的输出向用户报告, 不自愈.\n5. 上表未列出的 reason 不存在. 未知 reason 一律停止自动重试.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1776303428059}}
{"type":"message","id":"bbaac446","parentId":"b2f66a72","timestamp":"2026-04-16T01:37:12.642Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Figuring out runner.py use**\n\nI’m trying to confirm if runner.py, which seems to be located at the root, is the correct file to use. I believe I need to call runner with set_target, but then there's the question about whether I need to create state.json. I’m planning to investigate the runner's location to gather better context about how everything fits together. Let's see if I can find where runner.py is exactly.","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_087388a10928779c0169e03d4562308191a56bf09a6bfb359c\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABp4D1I5hKji_N-waalUVn8PALE0Sd5mW9bxif4j249cqsAPFVZoROe6MJkNO9e9qiF-z37LAIJUxXzq57pc5YDHljhHFxf-M2Y7DV4co8XhZGLeRCV6HFxaiyzj_RE8XOUHCDJ51RlpBMkh_JFFk8EZpp_-owHF-lrrbfm0XO1PZb-8v7Q5mLHsl5TUkoZTMslPifVofAp_XL348aO7oXiLMyGrmQa5tU_5ECHQAB1PnnFmzwer5KFjODETKwK0l2Q2QcR1ztvowXsQmTIq4YngK2Ud0qa2aLHfX0FyZm4MHFDBF1eCkD3jopIpKS5c_b4UkLqx9Pj5ujk2uvobo19x5hE27z3NCNpJyeqv4czB5-SgGW7NBKEdCbAUuS3EIRpCi_ukzw745kg1PT6NOgEKUM6JccVp_RAKSVd2n2LCHkhbBq4J5z-3nN_5bqZJEGV21w_gLDAQoJn3diXVTjI-l0uEaHR5zQWAucx2B1Uss-Uzr0gXvF7l-uqcUuEGDjmNaxcS9dVFH1-EmV5sLfjsUhgI36n52HP4-CIxvV6d1Y1nhAvtThwARa4u3P9odvsn25g_n5oau4IlN8GYzhjBvhXfL2DoI-6Ud8cCVYnXXQQAZ_-__dHaJOhja4Dv3GdRy32nc2-Hp47ZAtSjUq7C46Yg2XnPBXkcp7s1Y_L9Vq32iWi58FLjwJRE0r8FJ9972ZvXRaQJP8IFQbzph2qBytQpjK363vQHu-9_VBQPv3wSnzJvyGgz8tBD4EzSWkKJ9i2pKqTV7Bbd01tzhasyRlYYtJ_jwolqvG8Upjha7H3SRq9Ae87O1Crro6Ghbl3XC4atf_K869ckhRuSfUv61wl6OENTtyKOCtSgqRRYlU76jeAI890JaqLS9qy8HSukY45KUkFIOGCDcaZcK97Q-x1jtoj7vCxtQFdBndGZLFTE792m87W8AC97aqn3jLDZ9ECVYMzKvPmeEHts1KRYT4GLFSKLXCAAuPoNiN3h8BBGVTuv9hmbGKfRcgaJWXotPdJdONePdV5kCYHakKKV1VDgA==\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Figuring out runner.py use**\\n\\nI’m trying to confirm if runner.py, which seems to be located at the root, is the correct file to use. I believe I need to cal