 2. Next, I need to work with the skill `fuiou_fill_step2_merchant` using the runner. I have to provide the address and other details. It might read constants from the Markdown file. We already have the detailed address and contact name, so I should open the skill's Markdown file to check the required inputs. This way, I can ensure I have everything I need!\"}]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_vmZPHrGtE7mLyhcj5OvVJaiP|fc_087388a10928779c0169e03f0af8cc8191a5ae12535f1da76a","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"skills/fuiou_merchant_onboarding_skill/fuiou_fill_step2_merchant/SKILL.md"},"partialJson":"{\"path\":\"skills/fuiou_merchant_onboarding_skill/fuiou_fill_step2_merchant/SKILL.md\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.2","usage":{"input":215,"output":94,"cacheRead":24704,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":25013,"cost":{"input":0.00037625,"output":0.001316,"cacheRead":0.0043232,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00601545}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776303875542}}
{"type":"message","id":"62ec5ae8","parentId":"84c28a18","timestamp":"2026-04-16T01:44:43.495Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_vmZPHrGtE7mLyhcj5OvVJaiP|fc_087388a10928779c0169e03f0af8cc8191a5ae12535f1da76a","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: fuiou_fill_step2_merchant\ndescription: 富友通商户入网 Step2「商户信息」自动填表。处理凭条名称截断、详细地址、同法人信息回填、联系人姓名替换、手机号、下一步。当前屏幕位于商户入网表单 Step2 时使用。\n---\n\n# fuiou_fill_step2_merchant\n\n## 硬编码常量（写死在 runner.py）\n\n| 常量 | 值 |\n|---|---|\n| ADB | `/opt/homebrew/bin/adb` |\n| DEVICE | `GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK` |\n| DATA_DIR | `/Users/chongya/Desktop/入网资料` |\n| CONTACT_MD | `/Users/chongya/Desktop/入网资料/地址、联系人、电话.md` |\n| RECEIPT_LIMIT | 20（凭条打印名称字符上限） |\n| SOFT_SWIPE | `(540,1500)→(540,1050)` 幅度 450px，700ms |\n\n> **温和 swipe 铁律**：幅度必须 ≤450 像素、时长 ≥600ms。大幅度/快速 swipe 会触发 fuiou 表单的下拉刷新/弹回逻辑，**已填字段会被清空**（已踩坑）。\n\n## 唯一入口\n\n```bash\npython3 runner.py run_all\n```\n\n输出 JSON：`{\"status\":\"OK\"|\"NEED_LLM\"|\"FAIL\", ...}`\n\n退出码：`0` 成功，`1` FAIL，`2` NEED_LLM。\n\n## 业务规则（写死在 runner.py，勿口述）\n\n1. `凭条打印名称` 若 `len>20` 或含 `（…）`：去括号内容 + 去尾部数字 → 硬截断到 20 字\n2. `详细地址` 中的英文 `.` 自动替换为中文 `、`（fuiou 校验拒绝 `.`）\n3. 先填 `详细地址` → 再点 `同法人信息` → 再改 `联系人姓名`（md 有则覆盖，无则保留法人名）→ 再覆盖 `手机号`\n4. 提交前原地 dump 核对三字段（地址/联系人/手机），**不 swipe**，避免刷新\n5. 温和 swipe 最多 4 次将 `nextBtn` 滑入视窗 → 点击\n6. 校验跳到 `结算信息` 页判定成功\n\n## NEED_LLM 处理表（reason 与 runner.py 完全一致）\n\n| reason | llm_action |\n|---|---|\n| `contact_md_not_found` | 检查 `/Users/chongya/Desktop/入网资料/地址、联系人、电话.md` 是否存在；确认 DATA_DIR 路径 |\n| `contact_md_missing_field` | md 缺 `详细地址:` 或 `联系电话:`；补全字段后重跑 `run_all` |\n| `not_on_merchant_info_page` | 手动导航至 商户入网 → 完成 Step1 执照信息 → 进入 Step2 → 重跑 `run_all` |\n| `receipt_name_field_not_found` | 当前 UI 缺「凭条打印名称」行；确认页面正确；重跑 `run_all` |\n| `receipt_name_shorten_failed` | 自动截断后仍 >20 字；手动改凭条名称至 ≤20 字；重跑 `run_all` |\n| `addr_field_not_found` | 缺「详细地址」行；确认页面；重跑 `run_all` |\n| `same_legal_btn_not_found` | 缺「同法人信息」按钮；确认页面；重跑 `run_all` |\n| `contact_name_field_not_found` | 缺「商户联系人」输入框；重跑 `run_all` |\n| `phone_field_not_found` | 缺「商户联系人手机号」输入框；重跑 `run_all` |\n| `phone_invalid` | md 解析出的手机号不是 11 位数字；修正 md；重跑 `run_all` |\n| `pre_next_verify_failed` | 提交前字段核对不一致，大概率 swipe 过猛被刷新。减小 `SOFT_SWIPE` 幅度后重跑 `run_all`；`issues` 字段列出了不一致字段 |\n| `next_btn_unreachable` | 4 次温和上滑后 nextBtn 仍不可见；截图确认键盘遮挡或布局异常；必要时手动轻滑后重跑 `run_all` |\n| `form_validation_failed` | 下一步后仍在商户信息页，校验失败。常见：凭条名>20字 / 地址含`.` / 电话非11位 / 其他必填缺失；dump 或截图读红色错误；修正后重跑 `run_all` |\n| `unknown_page_state` | 页面既不是商户信息也不是结算信息；截图判定并导航回 Step2 后重跑 `run_all` |\n| `adb_error` | ADB 命令失败；检查 `adb devices` 连接状态；重跑 `run_all` |\n\n## 子命令（调试/恢复用）\n\n| 命令 | 作用 |\n|---|---|\n| `python3 runner.py run_all` | 全流程（默认） |\n| `python3 runner.py gate` | 判断当前页面 |\n| `python3 runner.py dump_fields` | 打印当前各字段实际值 |\n| `python3 runner.py load_contact` | 显示 md 解析结果 |\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1776303883486}}
