{"type":"message","id":"bd990eb2","parentId":"b553fa41","timestamp":"2026-04-16T01:46:09.043Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_PsfsobnkgE3AKjeEmGCxBMFT|fc_087388a10928779c0169e03f6050c48191ba92d392056feb70","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# step3of5-settlement\n\n填写 \"商户入网 - 结算信息 (3/5 步)\" 全部字段：上传对公户开户凭证、结算方式、结算周期、账号、开户城市、开户银行、开户行名称（含行号自动回填）。\n\n## 常量 (硬编码在 runner.py)\n\n```\nADB            = /opt/homebrew/Caskroom/android-platform-tools/36.0.2/platform-tools/adb\nDEVICE         = GAUOMVKR79ZPYPVK\nPKG            = com.fuiou.pay.fybussess\nOCR            = PaddleOCR v3 (use_textline_orientation=False, lang=ch)\nMETHOD_TARGET  = 对公清算\nCYCLE_TARGET   = 自动结算(T1)\nPUBLIC_ACCOUNT_VOUCHER_JPG = /Users/chongya/Desktop/入网资料/对公账户.jpg\nCONTACT_INFO_MD            = /Users/chongya/Desktop/入网资料/地址、联系人、电话.md\nFORM_STEP_NUM  = 3\n```\n\n## 入口\n\n```\n./run_conda.sh run_all\n```\n\n`run_all` 流程:\n```\ngate_in_form → upload 公户开户凭证\n  → fill method (picker) → fill cycle (picker)\n  → fill 账号 → fill 开户城市 (picker) → fill 开户银行 (picker)\n  → fill 开户行名称 (u2 AutoComplete dropdown → 行号自动回填)\n  → OK step3_settlement_filled\n```\n\n## NEED_LLM 处理表\n\nreason 字段与 runner.py 的 `result_need_llm()` 完全一致, 一行一行对应.\n\n| reason                     | 触发条件                                                  | llm_action (runner 返回里带)                                      |\n| -------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| not_on_form_page           | gate 时不在结算信息表单页 (或 progressTv != \"3\")          | `python3 runner.py diagnose_page`                                 |\n| file_not_found             | 上传凭证图或读材料时, 本地文件路径不存在                  | 检查对应文件路径是否存在                                          |\n| target_missing             | OCR/md 解析材料后缺少必要字段 (账号/银行/城市等)          | `python3 runner.py dump_targets`                                  |\n| image_slot_not_found       | 找不到对公户开户凭证上传槽位                              | `python3 runner.py dump_debug`                                    |\n| upload_dialog_not_found    | 点上传槽位后未弹出\"从相册选择\"                            | `python3 runner.py dump_debug`                                    |\n| gallery_not_opened         | 点\"从相册选择\"后未进入相册                                | `python3 runner.py dump_debug`                                    |\n| preview_not_opened         | 点缩略图后未进入预览页（找不到 btnCheck）                 | `python3 runner.py dump_debug`                                    |\n| preview_no_finish          | 预览页没有完成按钮（picture_right）                       | `python3 runner.py dump_debug`                                    |\n| picker_not_open            | tap 字段后目标 picker 未弹出                              | `python3 runner.py diagnose_page`                                 |\n| ocr_empty                  | 某列 OCR 没识别到任何文字                                 | `python3 runner.py dump_debug --picker <name>`                    |\n| target_not_in_list         | 两个方向盲滑都撞边界, 目标仍不可见                        | `python3 runner.py list_column --picker <name> --col v`           |\n| scroll_exhausted           | 达到 MAX_SCROLL_TRIES=12 仍未命中                         | `python3 runner.py list_column --picker <name> --col v`           |\n| confirm_failed             | 点确定后 picker 仍在前台                                  | `python3 runner.py dump_debug --picker <name>`                    |\n| field_not_found            | 填写或验证时找不到字段节点                                | `python3 runner.py diagnose_page`                                 |\n| field_mismatch             | 填完后字段显示的文本与 target 不符                        | `python3 runner.py diagnose_page`                                 |\n| branch_dropdown_not_found  | 开户行名称输入后 u2 找不到下拉建议项                      | `python3 runner.py diagnose_page`                                 |\n| adb_dump_ui_failed         | 开户行名称校验阶段 adb uiautomator dump 重试后仍失败      | `python3 runner.py diagnose_page`                                 |\n| branch_code_not_filled     | 点建议项后开户行行号未自动回填                            | `python3 runner.py diagnose_page`                                 |\n\n## LLM 处理规则\n\n1. 收到 NEED_LLM 只处理**当前这一步**, 处理完立即重跑 `run_all`, 绝不手动接管后续.\n2. `not_on_form_page`: 调 `diagnose_page`, 向用户报告, 不自愈.\n3. `file_not_found` / `target_missing`: 报告给用户, 不自己猜路径或值.\n4. 其他 reason: 读 llm_action 指定命令的输出向用户报告, 不自愈.\n5. 上表未列出的 reason 不存在. 未知 reason 一律停止自动重试.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1776303969034}}
